            </note>
            <note corresp="#d816-f3" n="4" xml:id="d816-f3-content">
                <p>Anthony Eden, British Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d816-f4" n="5" xml:id="d816-f4-content">
                <p>British representative on the United Nations War Crimes Commission, and Chairman
                    of the Commission.</p>
            </note>
